flowchart TD
  START[Validated authenticated chat request] --> OPEN[Create agents and validate inference configuration]
  OPEN --> SELECT[CloudAgent asks model for allowlisted audit tool calls]
  SELECT --> CHECK{Known unique tools and empty JSON arguments?}
  CHECK -->|no| ERR[Safe AppError; no completed assessment]
  CHECK -->|yes| EXEC[Execute selected read-only tools sequentially via asyncio.to_thread]
  EXEC --> REPORT[Validate AuditReport and count severities]
  REPORT --> RETRIEVE[Retrieve local FAISS guidance]
  RETRIEVE --> COMP[ComplianceAgent reviews audit plus retrieved passages]
  COMP --> SEN[SeniorAgent reviews structured audit plus compliance text]
  SEN --> SAVE[Persist completed assessment]
  SAVE --> OUT[Return separate outputs and live citations]
  EXEC -.->|failure| ERR
  RETRIEVE -.->|failure| ERR
  COMP -.->|provider failure| ERR
  SEN -.->|provider failure| ERR
  NOTE[Senior semantic rejection is prompt-guided, not a deterministic certification gate] -.-> SEN
